Z||000007||GodSend||11-29-2001||09:35 AM||||I hear you on the WOT, but I was thinking of an "in addition to".  So you have WOT .. and then you hit the button and .... BAM! ...<P><BR>So if you hit the button when you are just idling (or crusing at 2000 rpms) nothing happens.. make sense?<P>Besides.. with just a WOT switch you would be getting the juice every time you whomped down on the gas.  Don't you still need a switch to turn on the NOS (ie... if switch is off, you don't get any juice regardless)<P>||||reg||1
