Z||000009||Formula||11-29-2001||09:54 PM||||he wants you to hook your horn up so it only works at WOT... or Wide Open Throttle.<BR>---<BR>I understand what you mean about having the steering wheel button as an activation button.  But shouldnt you have it as a toggle switch?  Unless you use 1 to turn the circuit on and a differnt one to turn it off and have an LED in the gauge cluster to tell you when its on or off.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Untitled-1_copy.gif"> ||||reg||1
